            <ArticleTitle>Teenager with an irritable hip, anaemia and malaise.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>701-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We have described a boy with a juvenile spondyloarthropathy who also showed inflammatory changes in the gut. Gastrointestinal symptoms initially indicated the presence of an inflammatory bowel disease, but this was excluded histopathologically.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
